# How the three accounts' branches merge without a fight (CR, Tj 2026-10-19). tools/push.sh merges main into a session's branch by itself (a clean merge only):
# these append-mostly logs keep BOTH sides' new lines instead of conflicting, and CHECKPOINT.md (rewritten whole by every ckpt.sh) keeps the branch's own copy
# (the "ours" driver is set by push.sh: git config merge.ours.driver true). Everything else merges normally; a real conflict is never committed.
INBOX.md merge=union
TASKS.md merge=union
BUILDLOG.md merge=union
research/lab/NOTES.md merge=union
research/review/CHANGES.md merge=union
CHECKPOINT.md merge=ours
